repository-code: https://github.com/Global-Ecosystems-Atlas/data-catalogue
url: https://www.globalecosystemsatlas.org
abstract: >-
  The Global Ecosystems Atlas Data Catalogue is a tabular summary of all
  datasets evaluated for inclusion in the Global Ecosystems
  Atlas Synthesis Map. Each row in the database corresponds to a
  geospatial dataset identified as a potential source of
  geospatial data representing ecosystems.
keywords:
  - ecosystem
  - spatial data
  - global ecosystem typology
  - biodiversity data
